  "notes": "Material-ish palette (#2196f3 blue, #f44336 red, #4caf50 green) on a single white rounded panel. Signed currency colors carry meaning: negative balance & expenses red, income green. Summary tiles use 4px colored left borders (green income, red expenses); recurring transactions get a blue left border, a ↻ glyph and a faint blue '(Recurring)' tag. Each transaction card has a pale red trash icon. Sort control is a gray pill with a white raised selected segment (calendar vs $) plus a separate arrow for direction. Add Transaction opens a modal (not in capture) with an Income/Expense segmented toggle and a Recurring checkbox. Export as CSV/PDF in a bordered segmented group at bottom. Delete click showed no visible in-page confirmation on the live copy (may use native confirm)."
